en":[{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"M18 20a6 6 0 0 0-12 0"},"children":[]},{"tag":"circle","props":{"cx":"12","cy":"10","r":"4"},"children":[]},{"tag":"circle","props":{"cx":"12","cy":"12","r":"10"},"children":[]}]},{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["Sign in to sync"]}]}]}]},{"tag":"main","props":{"className":"life-reader life-tip-layout"},"children":[{"tag":"aside","props":{"className":"life-reader-sidebar life-tip-sidebar"},"children":[{"tag":"a","props":{"className":"life-back-link","href":"/en/book/11"},"children":[{"tag":"svg","props":{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"16","height":"16","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2","strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-arrow-left","aria-hidden":"true"},"children":[{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"m12 19-7-7 7-7"},"children":[]},{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"M19 12H5"},"children":[]}]},"Back to index"]},{"tag":"div","props":{"className":"life-sidebar-caption"},"children":["Common legal pitfalls for programmers and tech professionals"]},{"tag":"nav","props":{"aria-label":"Chapter entries"},"children":[{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/en/tip/11-01"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["01"]},"Before acting, ask whether the manufacturer, platform or company will report it to police; if criminal proceedings follow, contact a criminal defense lawyer immediately"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/en/tip/11-02"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["02"]},"Do not make or sell game cheats and assistance tools, including AI assistance that “only reads the screen and never touches memory,” or modified software that adds features to apps such as WeChat"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/en/tip/11-03"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["03"]},"Do not write or sell scripts for ticket snatching, flash sales, fake orders, or coupon farming — even if they merely “automate button clicks”"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/en/tip/11-04"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["04"]},"The crawler only accesses publicly available pages that require no login; it does not attempt to bypass anti-scraping measures or handle any personal information, and any data it collects is never sold"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/en/tip/11-05"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["05"]},"Refuse development orders for gambling, fraud, or adult-content apps; do not set up payment gateways or unblock accounts for such “clients”"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/en/tip/11-06"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["06"]},"Upon leaving a job, return all account access rights; do not delete databases, leave backdoors, or alter password protection systems — even if the employer owes you wages"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/en/tip/11-07"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["07"]},"Do not take source code, client lists, or technical documents upon leaving; do not upload them to personal cloud drives or reuse them at new employers"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/en/tip/11-08"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["08"]},"Do not run your own programs on others’ computers, servers, or cameras; do not use company machines for mining"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/en/tip/11-09"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["09"]},"Testing someone else’s systems without written permission — “good intentions” and “reporting afterward” are not excuses"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"aria-current":"page","className":"active","href":"/en/tip/11-10","data-status":"active"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["10"]},"Vulnerabilities must be reported per regulations; no details, exploit tools, or disclosure to foreign entities before patching"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/en/tip/11-11"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["11"]},"No selling of tools for bypassing firewalls or VPN accounts, no setting up such nodes for others"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/en/tip/11-12"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["12"]},"After signing a non-compete agreement, if the employer fails to pay compensation monthly, send a written notice; if payment still doesn’t come after 3 months, you may terminate the agreement. Workers who never handled any trade secrets can request that the clause be declared invalid"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/en/tip/11-13"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["13"]},"Code written during work hours using company resources belongs to the company; personal open‑source projects should be done in your own time and on your own equipment, without mixing them"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/en/tip/11-14"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["14"]},"Using open-source code such as GPL in products: Open-source it per the license or switch licenses — don’t treat this as “no one cares”"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/en/tip/11-15"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["15"]},"Only collect personal data strictly necessary for the app’s operation; consent from guardians is required for users under 14, and the privacy policy must be clearly written"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/en/tip/11-16"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["16"]},"Before launching a website or app, complete ICP registration and retain logs for at least 6 months per classification protection requirements"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/en/tip/11-17"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["17"]},"Before offering generative AI services to the public, conduct required safety assessments and algorithm registration; mark all generated content"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/en/tip/11-18"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["18"]},"Do not make or distribute tools that automatically skip or block other apps’ ads; free tools that work offline can still constitute unfair competition"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/en/tip/11-19"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["19"]},"Do not set up an “AI proxy site” to resell foreign large-model API access cheaply: an operator in Shanghai has already been placed in criminal detention"]}]}]},{"tag":"div","props":{"className":"life-tip-page"},"children":[{"tag":"nav","props":{"className":"life-tip-breadcrumb","aria-label":"Breadcrumb"},"children":[{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/en/book"},"children":["Explore the book"]},{"tag":"span","props":{"aria-hidden":"true"},"children":["/"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/en/book/11"},"children":["Chapter 11"," ·"," ","Common legal pitfalls for programmers and tech professionals"]}]},{"tag":"article","props":{"className":"life-entry-card status-unmarked is-standalone","id":"11-10"},"children":[{"tag":"div","props":{"className":"life-entry-top"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{"className":"life-entry-number"},"children":["10"]},{"tag":"span","props":{"className":"life-evidence grade-a"},"children":["Evidence"," ","A"]}]},{"tag":"h1","props":{"lang":"en"},"children":["Vulnerabilities must be reported per regulations; no details, exploit tools, or disclosure to foreign entities before patching"]},{"tag":"p","props":{"lang":"en","className":"life-entry-summary"},"children":["The “Regulations on the Management of Security Vulnerabilities in Network Products” applies not only to companies but also to individuals. There are five strict rules for vulnerability disclosure; the first two state that no details about vulnerabilities affecting active systems may be released before a vendor provides a fix. Additionally, no programs or tools specifically designed to exploit those vulnerabilities may be published, and any release must include instructions on how to remediate them. One often-overlooked rule: unreported vulnerabilities must not be shared with any foreign organizations or individuals outside the vendor."]},{"tag":"div","props":{"className":"life-entry-impact"},"children":[{"tag":"div","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["Cost"]},{"tag":"p","props":{},"children":["No cost involved. Simply report the vulnerability to the p…"]}]},{"tag":"div","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["Benefit"]},{"tag":"p","props":{},"children":["These regulations govern three main groups: domestic network product vendors, network operators, and any organ…"]}]}]},{"tag":"div","props":{"className":"life-entry-actions","aria-label":"Mark: Vulnerabilities must be reported per regulations; no details, exploit tools, or disclosure to foreign entities before patching"},"children":[{"tag":"button","props":{"type":"button","className":"life-action done","aria-pressed":"false"},"children":[{"tag":"svg","props":{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"16","height":"16","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2","strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-check","aria-hidden":"true"},"children":[{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"M20 6 9 17l-5-5"},"children":[]}]},"Done"]},{"tag":"button","props":{"type":"button","className":"life-action todo","aria-pressed":"false"},"children":[{"tag":"svg","props":{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"16","height":"16","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2","strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-list-todo","aria-hidden":"true"},"children":[{"tag":"rect","props":{"x":"3","y":"5","width":"6","height":"6","rx":"1"},"children":[]},{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"m3 17 2 2 4-4"},"children":[]},{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"M13 6h8"},"children":[]},{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"M13 12h8"},"children":[]},{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"M13 18h8"},"children":[]}]},"Plan to do"]},{"tag":"button","props":{"type":"button","className":"life-action favorite","aria-pressed":"false"},"children":[{"tag":"svg","props":{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"16","height":"16","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2","strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-bookmark","aria-hidden":"true"},"children":[{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"m19 21-7-4-7 4V5a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h10a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v16z"},"children":[]}]},"Save"]}," ",{"tag":"button","props":{"type":"button","className":"social-share-trigger"},"children":[{"tag":"svg","props":{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"16","height":"16","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2","strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-share2 lucide-share-2","aria-hidden":"true"},"children":[{"tag":"circle","props":{"cx":"18","cy":"5","r":"3"},"children":[]},{"tag":"circle","props":{"cx":"6","cy":"12","r":"3"},"children":[]},{"tag":"circle","props":{"cx":"18","cy":"19","r":"3"},"children":[]},{"tag":"line","props":{"x1":"8.59","x2":"15.42","y1":"13.51","y2":"17.49"},"children":[]},{"tag":"line","props":{"x1":"15.41","x2":"8.59","y1":"6.51","y2":"10.49"},"children":[]}]},"Share this tip"]}]},{"tag":"button","props":{"type":"button","className":"life-detail-toggle","aria-expanded":"true"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"svg","props":{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"10","height":"10","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"currentColor","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2","strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-circle","aria-hidden":"true"},"children":[{"tag":"circle","props":{"cx":"12","cy":"12","r":"10"},"children":[]}]},"Hide details"]},{"tag":"svg","props":{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"16","height":"16","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2","strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-chevron-down rotated","aria-hidden":"true"},"children":[{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"m6 9 6 6 6-6"},"children":[]}]}]},{"tag":"div","props":{"className":"life-entry-details"},"children":[{"tag":"div","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{"className":"life-detail-label"},"children":["Cost"]},{"tag":"p","props":{},"children":["No cost involved. Simply report the vulnerability to the product vendor or an official platform. Until the vendor releases a patch, no details or verification code should be disclosed."]}]},{"tag":"div","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{"className":"life-detail-label"},"children":["Benefit"]},{"tag":"p","props":{},"children":["These regulations govern three main groups: domestic network product vendors, network operators, and any organizations or individuals involved in discovering, collecting, or publishing vulnerability information. No entity may use vulnerabilities to compromise network security, nor may they illegally collect, sell, or distribute such information. Five additional rules apply to public disclosure: first, nothing may be released before a vendor provides a patch; second, no details about vulnerabilities in active networks or systems may be published; third, no exaggerated claims about risks or malicious exploitation attempts may be made; fourth, no tools or programs designed for malicious exploitation may be released; and fifth, any disclosure must include remediation steps. Unreported vulnerabilities must also not be shared with foreign entities. The regulations encourage reporting to four official platforms: the Ministry of Industry and Information Technology’s Cybersecurity Threat and Vulnerability Information Sharing Platform; the National Cybersecurity Information Notification Center’s Vulnerability Platform; the National Computer Network Emergency Response Technical Team/Coordination Center of China’s Vulnerability Platform; and the China Information Security Evaluation Center’s Vulnerability Database. Violators may face penalties ranging from fines of 10,000 to 100,000 RMB, suspension of services, revocation of licenses or business licenses, and even criminal liability for responsible personnel."]}]},{"tag":"div","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{"className":"life-detail-label"},"children":["Original sources"]},{"tag":"p","props":{"className":"life-citations"},"children":["工业和信息化部、国家互联网信息办公室、公安部 (2021). 网络产品安全漏洞管理规定（工信部联网安〔2021〕66 号，第二、四、九、十、十四条，2021 年 9 月 1 日施行）. ",{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"https://www.gov.cn/gongbao/content/2021/content_5641351.htm","target":"_blank","rel":"noopener noreferrer"},"children":["https://www.gov.cn/gongbao/content/2021/content_5641351.htm"]},"；全国人大常委会 (2025). 网络安全法（2025 年修正，2026 年 1 月 1 日施行，第二十八、六十五条；2016 年文本为第二十六、六十二条，规定第十四条援引的是 2016 年文本的条号）. ",{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"https://www.cac.gov.cn/2025-12/29/c_1768735112911946.htm","target":"_blank","rel":"noopener noreferrer"},"children":["https://www.cac.gov.cn/2025-12/29/c_1768735112911946.htm"]}]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"https://www.gov.cn/gongbao/content/2021/content_5641351.htm","target":"_blank","rel":"noopener noreferrer","className":"life-source-link"},"children":["Open source link"," ",{"tag":"svg","props":{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"13","height":"13","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2","strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-external-link","aria-hidden":"true"},"children":[{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"M15 3h6v6"},"children":[]},{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"M10 14 21 3"},"children":[]},{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"M18 13v6a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V8a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h6"},"children":[]}]}]}]},{"tag":"div","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{"className":"life-detail-label"},"children":["Book note"]},{"tag":"p","props":{"className":"life-citations"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{"className":"life-content-reference"},"children":["This regulation explicitly includes individuals as subjects; claiming “I’m just an amateur” does not exempt anyone from compliance. Submitting vulnerabilities found in domestic systems to foreign bug bounty platforms violates the rule prohibiting disclosure to foreign entities. This rule addresses how vulnerabilities must be handled after discovery. Whether one is legally permitted to test systems depends on other provisions, such as the requirement for written authorization before testing any system. Even legally discovered vulnerabilities may incur penalties if disclosed improperly. Unauthorized testing results in violations on both fronts. Among reporting channels, the MIIT platform and CNCERT are most commonly used. The regulations do not specifically address cases where a vendor is notified but fails to act; in practice, documentation of negotiation and reporting processes is required before official submission."]}]}]},{"tag":"div","props":{"className":"life-personal-note"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{"className":"life-detail-label"},"children":["My note"]},{"tag":"button","props":{"type":"button"},"children":["Write a reminder for yourself…"]}]}]}]},{"tag":"nav","props":{"className":"life-tip-pager"},"children":[{"tag":"a","props":{"className":"life-tip-pager-link","href":"/en/tip/11-09"},"children":[{"tag":"svg","props":{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"16","height":"16","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2","strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-arrow-left","aria-hidden":"true"},"children":[{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"m12 19-7-7 7-7"},"children":[]},{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"M19 12H5"},"children":[]}]},{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"small","props":{},"children":["Previous"]},"Testing someone else’s systems without written permission — “good intentions” and “reporting afterward” are not excuses"]}]},{"tag":"a","props":{"className":"life-tip-pager-link next","href":"/en/tip/11-11"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"small","props":{},"children":["Next"]},"No selling of tools for bypassing firewalls or VPN accounts, no sett